# WS2 external-mode tests

- Do not construct `Settings(api_exposure_mode="external", ...)` without
  `rate_limit_requests_per_minute` and `tenant_provider_budget_per_minute`
  unless the test intentionally asserts `Settings` validation failure.
- Use [`tests/ws2_test_fixtures.py`](../../tests/ws2_test_fixtures.py)
  `external_test_settings(**overrides)` for `create_app` and TestClient setup.
- Rate-limit tests that allow a full cache miss with semantic retrieval enabled
  need `tenant_provider_budget_per_minute` ≥ 2 (embedding + generation) unless
  `semantic_enabled=False`.
